{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在湖南永州月岩景區，陽光照射天然岩洞，透過空氣中的水汽與塵埃，呈現出清晰的光束，形成「金光穿洞」奇觀。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_3.J.HN.LIGHT.MTV.0910-1001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Q8E6O0PDt91790818253.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_3.J.HN.LIGHT.MTV.0910-1001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T01:58:47.190697+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":51,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}